{"suttaId":"tha-ap511","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3144,3161],"vripara":"85"},"segments":{"tha-ap511:0.3":"Tālaphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap511:1.1":"“Sataraṃsī nāma bhagavā, sayambhū aparājito;","tha-ap511:1.3":"Vivekā vuṭṭhahitvāna, gocarāyābhinikkhami.","tha-ap511:2.1":"“Phalahattho ahaṃ disvā, upagacchiṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap511:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, tālaphalaṃ adāsahaṃ.","tha-ap511:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap511:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap511:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap511:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap511:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap511:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tālaphaladāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap511:8.1":"Tālaphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
